# Local agent state
# `.dots/archive/` holds dots that the dot CLI moved out of the active list
# when a slice closed. The archived files are local-only state, like a
# scratch pad: they should not be tracked in git.
.dots/archive/
# `.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock` is a per-machine lock file written by the
# Claude Code scheduler. Local-only.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
